    "title": "「Прощание」正式上架",
    "cate": 1,
    "author": "塞壬唱片",
    "content": "<p></p><div class=\"media-wrap image-wrap\"><img id=\"37093f9b515377543a89dc2565ee949d\" title=\"图片.png\" alt=\"图片.png\" poster=\"\" src=\"https://web.hycdn.cn/siren/pic/20220222/37093f9b515377543a89dc2565ee949d.png\"/></div><p><span style=\"color:#cccccc\">战争哺育的伤痛，终将被止息。</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#cccccc\">战士们遍体鳞伤，而后铸剑为犁。</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#cccccc\">听啊，战后的严冬，热血浇筑的红砖炉，</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#cccccc\">Прощание，我们的英雄，我们的子民。</span></p>",
    "date": "2022-02-22"
  }
}